settings-position-picker-card-desc = Position this picker style and its filter bar and search panel without affecting the others.
settings-position-slices-card = Slices picker
settings-position-hex-card = Geometric picker
settings-position-wall-card = Wall picker
settings-position-sandy-card = Sandy picker
settings-position-hand-card = Card hand picker
settings-position-horizontal-label = Horizontal offset
settings-position-horizontal-desc = Move the picker left or right by a percentage of half the screen width. Positive values move it right.
settings-position-vertical-label = Vertical offset
settings-position-vertical-desc = Move the picker up or down by a percentage of half the screen height. Positive values move it down.
settings-position-frame-card = Picker frame
settings-position-frame-card-desc = Set the picker's position and size as percentages of the screen. Arrange updates these values when you move or resize the picker.
settings-position-frame-enabled-label = Use custom picker frame
settings-position-frame-enabled-desc = Use the position and size below for the picker.
settings-position-frame-x-label = Left edge
settings-position-frame-x-desc = Set the frame's left edge as a percentage of the screen width.
settings-position-frame-y-label = Top edge
settings-position-frame-y-desc = Set the frame's top edge as a percentage of the screen height.
settings-position-frame-width-label = Width
settings-position-frame-width-desc = Set the frame width as a percentage of the screen width.
settings-position-frame-height-label = Height
settings-position-frame-height-desc = Set the frame height as a percentage of the screen height.

settings-filter-position-enabled-label = Place bar independently
settings-filter-position-enabled-desc = Keep the filter bar at its own position when changing the picker.
settings-filter-position-x-label = Bar left
settings-filter-position-x-desc = Distance from the left edge, as a percentage of the display width.
settings-filter-position-y-label = Bar top
settings-filter-position-y-desc = Distance from the top edge, as a percentage of the display height.
